    "body": "Namespaced generation matrix with the same JWT/model `gpt-5.4-mini`: `/api/openai/v1/responses`, `/api/codex/v1/responses`, `/api/anthropic/v1/messages`, and `/api/qwen/v1/chat/completions` all return 200 and text; `/api/gemini/v1beta/models/gpt-5.4-mini:generateContent` returns 400 `no healthy gemini credential is available`. Thus Gemini uniquely routes by endpoint/provider instead of model ownership and breaks the universal-token cross-provider rule.",
